# PROJECT INDEX (READ FIRST)

## CORE ARCHITECTURE
- App Type: Android diary app (web-based UI layer)
- Data Flow:
  UI → State → Storage → Sync (Drive/Calendar)

---

## CORE FILES

### EDITOR
- diaryEditor.js → text editor, formatting, highlight, cursor handling
- colorPicker.js → text + highlight colour picker UI + logic

### UI VIEWS
- weekView.js → renders week cards, visible week refresh
- dayView.js → expanded day editor view
- calendarUI.js → calendar layout + scroll container

### STATE / DATA
- state.js → global app state (active day, editor state, etc.)
- storage.js → local save/load (pre-sync layer)

### SYNC

#### Google Drive
- driveSync.js → save/load diary data to Google Drive
- driveAuth.js → OAuth + token handling

#### Google Calendar
- calendarSync.js → push/pull events
- calendarTransform.js → map diary ↔ calendar events

---

## INTERACTIONS
- gestures.js → swipe + long press detection
  - used by: weekView.js, dayView.js

---

## COMMON ENTRY POINTS

Swipe issues  
→ gestures.js  

Highlight / colour bugs  
→ diaryEditor.js OR colorPicker.js  

Week not updating / UI stale  
→ weekView.js (refreshVisibleWeekCards)  

Day editor issues  
→ dayView.js  

Google Drive sync bugs  
→ driveSync.js  

Google Calendar sync bugs  
→ calendarSync.js  

Auth problems  
→ driveAuth.js  

---

## CRITICAL FUNCTIONS (HIGH TOUCH)

- refreshVisibleWeekCards() → week UI updates
- detectSwipe() → gesture handling
- _applyHiColor() → highlight logic
- syncToDrive() → push data
- syncFromDrive() → pull data

---

